          "identity_status": "provisional",
          "notes": "This provisional Edition identifies the Project Gutenberg electronic editorial manifestation numbered 4363, not an identified historical printing, an acquired Item, a particular downloaded file or every Helen Zimmern translation. The catalog and opening header/transcriber note were inspected on 2026-09-09 UTC. The transcriber distinguishes an e-text edition with typography, footnote and spelling adaptations and gives a broad Complete Works reference, not an exact printing identification. Only those pages and the opening note were assessed for this referent choice; the full translation and all offered formats were not compared. The English edition_statement is the opening heading, not a printed edition declaration. Provider release/update dates are not asserted Work, translation or print-publication chronology. The unchanged Expression preserves its earlier creation and attribution qualifications; its new embodiment link is a separate metadata event. No electronic-format equivalence, textual fidelity, acquired bytes, rights clearance, present availability or publication permission is admitted by this record.",
